#H1 Markdown pros and cons
Here is a lits of pros and cons to using Markdown to write your API documentation.

##H2 Markdown pros
Bullet list
* Markdown is lightweight.
* Markdown is easy to begin using.
* Markdown is supported on GitHub.

##H2 Markdown cons
Bullet list
* Not _all_ versions are interoperable.
* User **must**/ know which version is supported by the tools they use.
